  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:fgos:git:wal-record:v1",
  "title": "Publication WAL immutable envelope v1",
  "description": "Concrete PublicationCas graph. Other operation families remain unimplemented and are refused. SHA-256 covers recursively key-sorted UTF-8 JSON with digest omitted. Intent at sequence zero has null predecessor; every subsequent record hashes its predecessor. Semantic transitions, object-format validation, resource and live authority checks are Rust obligations. This file is evidence, never effect authority. An Intent/Prepared with no TargetAttempt may close record-only as abandonedBeforeAttempt under the same publication authority. An operation directory without installed record zero is no Intent; temporary files remain evidence but do not block admission."
